{"id":283213828,"title":"10.day10-python高级语法","summary":"第一章.安装第三方库1.标准库介绍2.引入第三方库","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184229433-aeebabe3-788a-41bd-a43d-631411eec24e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>第一章.安装第三方库</h1>\n<h2>1.标准库介绍</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184261668-fc2a1bb9-e004-404a-b160-dbad457b4a43.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184271299-04400966-d095-468a-af78-67e3c5a3c885.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h2>2.引入第三方库</h2>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184293355-d8ceddac-f92d-4bbe-81c2-3f5f8ce6a015.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>2.1.pip命令方式引入第三方库</h3>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184313362-71fb54b8-0698-479d-9c6f-730d16e93c0f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>2.1.1.pip常用命令</h4>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184456227-2a68f198-85d7-4e9a-9489-22f5e1695e56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184464476-1ec3023f-1189-4256-8968-31b97477cc8d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>2.2.使用pycharm中引入第三方库</h3>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184529269-24a1a68c-f91f-46f7-9786-52161b9d9047.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h4>2.2.1.在pycharm终端安装和卸载库</h4>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184537196-4a34f2a6-7e9a-4af3-a192-1006ba4e10f4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1789184545779-28ee0a0d-ec81-4252-9a0e-9380104df4d1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/p